title: A row of the file list shows small buttons while the pointer is on it: a plus on a folder that asks for a file or a folder and names it in the folder's own rows; the folders of the workspace have no plus
folders: tree-move, tree-other
expect-file: tree-move/lib/fresh.txt ::
expect-file: tree-move/lib/sub/inner.txt ::
absent-file: tree-move/fresh.txt

wait 3500
left files
wait 1200
files hover lib
wait 1500
mark hover-folder
wait 300
files hover a.txt
wait 2000
mark hover-file
wait 300
files plus lib
wait 2500
mark plus-menu
wait 300
ui click 371 290
wait 1500
mark naming-inside-the-folder
wait 300
files text fresh.txt
wait 800
press enter
wait 2500
mark file-made
wait 300
files plus lib
wait 2500
ui click 371 290
wait 1500
files text sub/inner.txt
wait 800
press enter
wait 2500
mark nested-file-made
wait 500
quit
